<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>SkillSprint — Your Goals. Our Tracker. Better You.</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="site-header reveal">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="brand-mark">S</div>
        <div>
          <div class="brand-name">Skill<span>Sprint</span></div>
          <div class="brand-tag">Smart Student Progress Tracker</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav class="site-nav">
        <a href="#features" class="link">Features</a>
        <a href="#about" class="link">About</a>
        <a href="/login" class="btn btn-outline">Login</a>
        <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started →</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="reveal reveal-1">
        <div class="hero-eyebrow">✨ Plan · Study · Achieve</div>
        <h1><span class="g1">Your Goals.</span><br><span class="g2">Our Tracker.</span><br><span class="g3">Better You.</span></h1>
        <p class="lede">One place to track attendance, calculate your CGPA, take lecture notes, and stay connected with your college community — built for Indian engineering students.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-primary">→ Start Your Journey</a>
          <a href="/login" class="btn btn-outline">I already have an account</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stats">
          <div><b>75%</b><span>Min. attendance rule tracked</span></div>
          <div><b>10.0</b><span>CGPA scale calculator</span></div>
          <div><b>24/7</b><span>Community &amp; reminders</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-media reveal reveal-2" style="border:none; background:none; box-shadow:none; min-height:auto;">
        <div class="mascot-wrap" title="Tap me!">
          <div class="mascot-glow"></div>
          <span class="sparkle s1"></span>
          <span class="sparkle s2"></span>
          <span class="sparkle s3"></span>
          <span class="sparkle s4"></span>
          <div class="mascot-entrance">
            <img class="mascot-img" src="/img/duo.jpg" alt="Chetan and Aaditya">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="floating-card fc1">
          <div class="fc-icon" style="background:rgba(34,197,94,.18); color:var(--green);">✅</div>
          <div><div class="fc-title">Attendance: 92%</div><div class="fc-sub">You're clear to sit for exams</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="floating-card fc2">
          <div class="fc-icon" style="background:rgba(139,92,246,.18); color:var(--purple);">🎓</div>
          <div><div class="fc-title">CGPA: 8.7</div><div class="fc-sub">Sem 3 calculated</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="features" class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-1">
        <div class="feature-icon-tile" style="background:rgba(139,92,246,.12);">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8b5cf6" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M16 3v4M8 3v4M3 10h18"/><path d="M8.5 15l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Attendance Tracker</h4>
        <p>Mark every lecture, know instantly if you're above the 75% rule.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-2">
        <div class="feature-icon-tile" style="background:rgba(59,130,246,.12);">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M8 7h8M8 11h2M12 11h2M16 11h0M8 15h2M12 15h2M16 15h0"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>CGPA Calculator</h4>
        <p>Semester-wise marks and SGPA, rolled up into your overall CGPA.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-3">
        <div class="feature-icon-tile" style="background:rgba(34,211,238,.12);">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#22d3ee" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M4 4h13a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4z"/><path d="M4 4v16M8 8h7M8 12h7M8 16h4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Lecture Notes</h4>
        <p>Write and organize notes for every subject, right after class.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-4">
        <div class="feature-icon-tile" style="background:rgba(236,72,153,.12);">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#ec4899" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>College Community</h4>
        <p>Auto-joined chat with your college, year, and stream.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-4">
        <div class="feature-icon-tile" style="background:rgba(245,158,11,.12);">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"/><path d="M13.73 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.46 0"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Reminders</h4>
        <p>Never forget what a teacher assigned — tasks stay pinned per subject.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="stats-band icon-banner reveal">
      <div class="band-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><path d="M22 10L12 5 2 10l10 5 10-5z"/><path d="M6 12v5c0 1.5 3 3 6 3s6-1.5 6-3v-5"/><path d="M22 10v6"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="stats-band-content">
        <div><b>800+</b><span>Colleges under University of Mumbai alone</span></div>
        <div><b>10.0</b><span>Point CGPA scale, fully calculated</span></div>
        <div><b>75%</b><span>The rule every student tracks — now automatic</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="slogan-strip reveal">"<b>Small steps every day</b> lead to big results."</p>
  </div>

  <script>
    document.querySelector('.mascot-wrap .mascot-img').addEventListener('click', function () {
      this.classList.remove('mascot-poke');
      void this.getBBox(); // restart animation (SVG-safe reflow trigger)
      this.classList.add('mascot-poke');
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
